{"last_link_id": 79, "nodes": [{"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["使用准确的标点来捕捉说话者的语调。模型学习说话者如何结束句子、提问或表达兴奋。\n\n- **对于一个语句：** `这是一个很好的例子。`\n-   **对于一个问题：** `这是一个很好的例子吗？`\n-   **为了增添兴奋感：** `这是一个绝佳的例子！`\n\n#### 3. **匹配音频和文本长度**\n音频片段应足够长，以捕捉说话者自然的语速和节奏。\n\n👍 **好的：**一段5 - 15秒的连续、清晰的语音片段。\n\n👌 **好的：** 一个3 - 5秒的片段。\n\n⚠️ **警告**：非常短的片段（< 3 秒）可能导致克隆声音不太稳定或听起来像机器人。\n\n\n>**注意：**\n>为获得最佳效果，请使用干净、高质量的 `prompt_audio`，尽量减少背景噪音、混响或音乐。模型将尝试克隆*整个*声学环境，而不仅仅是语音。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [440.80712890625, 393.0667419433594], "pos": [2276.6572265625, 319.9831237792969], "id": 44, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["提示词文案"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [210, 88], "pos": [1469.2745361328125, 441.0177917480469], "id": 4, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "model", "links": [47], "label": "model", "type": "QWEN3ASR_MODEL", "localized_name": "model"}], "size": [270, 82], "pos": [1918.499267578125, 769.031982421875], "widgets_values": ["Qwen3-ASR-1.7B", false], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "model_name"}, "name": "model_name", "label": "model_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "unload_after"}, "shape": 7, "name": "unload_after", "label": "unload_after", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "unload_after"}], "flags": {}, "id": 29, "type": "Qwen3ASRLoader", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Qwen3ASRLoader"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text", "links": [74], "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"name": "language", "label": "language", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "language"}], "size": [270, 78], "pos": [2266.868896484375, 841.123291015625], "widgets_values": ["Auto"], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 47, "label"